      "writtenOn": "2023-10-25T14:40:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What if the user is not using `out/Static`? For instance, I use `out/Debug` and `out/Release`, etc. I never use `out/Static`.\n\nAlso, assume we _are_ using `out/Static`. Won\u0027t this overwrite everything in `args.gn`? That would clobber the user\u0027s GN settings. This doesn\u0027t seem like it will actually work for real-world development.",
      "range": {
