        "id": 21544
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-11-06T07:48:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, the lifecycle of the reproxy daemon is being treated as one singular build invocation, so if you don\u0027t shut it down after the build, or you reuse it for more than one build, any reported metrics will be wrong. It will also cause incorrect builds, as reproxy caches file metadata during a build, so it will not notice changed files if you reuse it.",
      "parentUuid": "ec629040_01621073",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 85,
